<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: Czech Oct PPI rises 0.6 pct mo/mo, +4.1 pct yr/yr.</title>
<headline>Czech Oct PPI rises 0.6 pct mo/mo, +4.1 pct yr/yr.</headline>
<dateline>PRAGUE 1996-11-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Czech real industrial producer prices rose 0.6 percent in October putting prices 4.1 percent higher than in the same month in 1995, the Czech Statistical Bureau (CSU) said on Wednesday.</p>
</text>
